---
import Button from "../button.astro";
---

<section class="size-screen padding-auto">
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-10 lg:flex-row lg:gap-11">
        <img 
            src="/images/power_outlet.webp" 
            alt="Power Outlet" 
            loading="lazy"
        >

        <div class="col text-center gap-[26px] lg:mt-[60px] lg:text-start">
            <h1 class="title">Where We Power Your Savings</h1>

            <p class="paragraph [&>span]:font-semibold">
                <span>Pennsylvania -</span> Empowering over 15,000 customers with 95% satisfaction through tailored energy solutions.<br>
                <span>New Jersey -</span> Helping more than 12,000 users find smarter, greener, and more cost-effective energy plans.<br>
                <span>Illinois -</span> Trusted by 9,500 residents, achieving a 94% success rate in savings optimization.
            </p>

            <p class="paragraph [&>span]:font-semibold">
                <span>Unlock the Power of Smarter Energy with SmartRate Energy</span>
                partner for affordable, innovative, and eco-friendly solutions. Take control of your electricity and natural gas costs with bigger savings through exclusive cost-efficient rates, clear and predictable bills thanks to transparent pricing, and sustainable choices that reduce your carbon footprint while protecting your wallet and the planet.
            </p>
            <Button 
        text="Call now"
        className="!py-3 "
        link="tel:+12104852325"
        ></Button>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>